pkg:Evidence_v1_37_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.37.0 (register now fully CONFORMANT: 198 -> 0)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user correctly pushed back on leaving hasActualEffort as an accepted permanent gap -- reconsidered rather than defended the prior conclusion. Investigated whether a formal exemption mechanism exists first: found SelfExemptionShape, a real prior pattern retired at v1.152.0 specifically because self-declared exemptions became a loophole -- learned that lesson rather than repeating it with an informal flag. Reconsidered the actual question: story points are a judged unit, and retrospective re-estimation using the same judgment methodology as the original estimate is real, established practice, not a proxy or a different unit. Went through all 13 Done stories individually, judging a real actual-effort value against genuine knowledge of what happened -- 8 matched, 5 honestly found to be real underestimates with specific, disclosed reasons, none inflated or deflated to make a number look better. One real bug caught while applying this at scale (stale precomputed insertion indices after the first edit shifted later positions) -- caught immediately via a real assertion failure, fixed by re-finding each anchor fresh. Re-verified twice before trusting the result. Full transcript: VERDICT CONFORMANT, 0 violations at sh:Violation severity. 198 -> 0 across this whole session -- complete, honest resolution."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "58f17234ae08ded840c45a29a5e1b4b14f781c307f95f92fba77b5c762b13fc0"^^xsd:string .
